  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Formal quantifiers express proportion precisely: 'a majority of' (more than half), 'a handful of' (a small number), 'the vast majority of' (almost all). Common in reports and formal discussions: 'The vast majority of employees support the change.'",
    "explanation_ko": "격식체 수량 표현은 비율을 정확히 나타냅니다: 'a majority of'(과반수), 'a handful of'(소수), 'the vast majority of'(거의 전부). 보고서와 격식적 토론에서 흔합니다: 'The vast majority of employees support the change.'",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "A majority of the team agreed with the plan.",
        "ko": "팀의 과반수가 그 계획에 동의했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "Only a handful of people showed up.",
        "ko": "소수의 사람만 왔어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "The vast majority of customers were satisfied.",
        "ko": "고객의 대부분이 만족했어요."
      }
    ]
  },
